      "statement": "The prune-cache job runs only on main, waits for the three writer jobs with always(), and deletes every v0-rust-* cache entry that is not the newest for its key prefix through the actions/cache REST API using an actions:write permission scoped to that job; measured 2026-10-07 the repository held 5 v0-rust-* entries / 8.54 GB, of which 2.73 GB were superseded.",
